Error [E2411]: U64 can't be serialized
  --> tests/ui/serde_u64_direct_not_codable.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |     cbor.to_bytes(value)
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: Codable uses the shared DataTree model, whose Int values are signed 64-bit; U64 cannot round-trip every value
 Fix: convert the U64 to Int after checking it fits, or encode it as Text explicitly

Error [E2411]: U64 can't be decoded
  --> tests/ui/serde_u64_direct_not_codable.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     cbor.decode<U64>([U8].{ 0x01 })
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: Codable uses the shared DataTree model, whose Int values are signed 64-bit; U64 cannot round-trip every value
 Fix: decode an Int or Text and convert it to U64 explicitly
